{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2021-01", "window": 4, "start_date": 1611446400, "end_date": 1612137599, "month_true_total": 142, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:59:44 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "85725459", "author": {"steamid": "76561198105877801", "personaname": "Oncus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Oncus/", "num_games_owned": 1377, "num_reviews": 382, "playtime_forever": 539, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 539, "last_played": 1611355988, "avatar": "cb13e8b75fae2fb79d6134584af1b490c33c5e77"}, "language": "english", "review": "Wait, I spent only 9 hours on this game? It felt a LOT longer.\n\nI'm not a WH fan, so fidelity and references to the original material didn't really matter to me and I was only interested in the gameplay. At the end of the day, it was somewhat of an OK 3rd person shooter. The game tried to spice things up with jetpack levels, varied environments, upgrades to weapons etc. but I could not play more than a few hours per sitting. It took me months to finish it with all the breaks. It didn't matter how different the enemy is, or what weapon you were using, it boiled down to the same thing. \n\nThis is far from a state of the art game, BUT at every moment you can see that the devs really put their heart and soul into the game. This is ultimately the reason I decided to push it over the edge to a positive review. Just know what you're getting yourself into.", "timestamp_created": 1612136552, "timestamp_updated": 1612136552, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 14, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.669630467891693115", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "85724989", "author": {"steamid": "76561198975664380", "personaname": "CrampedNickel16", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/CrampedNickel16/", "num_games_owned": 140, "num_reviews": 63, "playtime_forever": 548, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 391, "last_played": 1645495449, "avatar": "346e3328e98c0daa61e44146f45e15d2ec286082"}, "language": "english", "review": "Don't look at reviews brother, you must stop the Orks! For the Emperor!", "timestamp_created": 1612135772, "timestamp_updated": 1612135772, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "85720468", "author": {"steamid": "76561198135466076", "personaname": "Nightbringer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198135466076/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1858, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 972, "last_played": 1700074232, "avatar": "6fdffbe3473bc8db710213e69eb7e85fb042498c"}, "language": "english", "review": "a very good game had it during child hood ald would allways recomend it to someone", "timestamp_created": 1612129211, "timestamp_updated": 1612129211, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "85669059", "author": {"steamid": "76561198148744658", "personaname": "General Gede?", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198148744658/", "num_games_owned": 251, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 652, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 652, "last_played": 1612063671, "avatar": "6617d48c5306cbd0fba1f7eb5da3ad851fa77d51"}, "language": "english", "review": "nemeroth is the one of the most pathetic daemon princes in existence. second only to voldorius.", "timestamp_created": 1612067029, "timestamp_updated": 1612067029, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "85659084", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044104100", "personaname": "Taylorpa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/taylorpa791/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 4786, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4786, "last_played": 1601695169, "avatar": "02b42d1dd905652dc33bc338a75361647ae77c56"}, "language": "english", "review": "Came back to this gem of a game after not playing for a few years and ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥.\n\nThere's a reason I have 80 hours on a game that has a linear 10-15 hour campaign: the combat mechanics and pacing are THAT good.\n\nRarely does a third person shooter make its gameplay feel so meaty while blending melee and ranged mechanics into a package that feels smooth and satisfying to play. \n\nThe excellent environments/ audio design and lore really add to the experience and capture that incredible grimdank Aesthetic that we all know and love.\n\nIf you're a fan of the universe of fan of third person shooters in general you can't afford to miss this one.", "timestamp_created": 1612052762, "timestamp_updated": 1612052762, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}